    {
      "id": "eligibility",
      "conclusion": "loadLock4Decode includes success, nonmissinggrabTimeC, liftRT<500, goodDLC=1, wrongZoneFirst=0, movementTime<500,timeToContact<1000,has_radical=1. Both smoothed-deconvolution and RADICaL preparation share this eligibility in the author route.",
